# "Hail — Return up to one target creature an opponent controls with mana value 3 or less to its owner's hand"
# (CR 115.1, 202.3, 608.2b). Bot2's She-Hulk, Jade Defender is {3}{G}, mana value 4, one above the limit, so it is no target
# at all; Bot1's own Ornithopter is no target either, whatever its mana value, because Hail wants a creature an opponent
# controls. Hail is still a mode that can be chosen, since "up to one" may be answered with none (CR 115.1c): with no legal
# target no question is asked at all, nothing returns, and both creatures stay on the battlefield.

